{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/dinavinter/grant-management/pull/1","repo":"dinavinter/grant-management","number":1,"set":"agent","source":"cursor","title":"Document local development environment setup","body":"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\n- Document local development environment setup findings in `.tasks/setup-dev-environment`.\n- Capture dependency installation results, typed CDS model generation, local run commands, and smoke-test outcomes.\n- Fix Aspire AppHost local orchestration so `cds`, `approuter`, and `portal` can run together through Aspire.\n- Include browser walkthrough evidence for Aspire dashboard, portal, API docs, and CAP service index.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `npm install`\n- `npm install --prefix app/portal`\n- `npx cds-typer srv --outputDirectory @cds-models --targetModuleType esm`\n- `npm run aspire:build`\n- `ASPIRE_LOCAL_ONLY=1 SKIP_BIND=1 ASPIRE_ENABLE_PORTAL=1 aspire run --detach --format Json`\n- `aspire ps --format Json --resources`\n- `curl` smoke checks for `localhost:4004`, `localhost:9000`, and `localhost:3000`\n- Browser walkthrough: <a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-3b6b771f-e661-465b-8614-a6c0839f4988/artifacts?path=%2Fopt%2Fcursor%2Fartifacts%2Faspire_host_local_stack_walkthrough.mp4\"><img src=\"https://cursor.com/artifacts/c/art-55f8733f-ce55-4b8e-abb8-ee1e9a849e19\" alt=\"aspire_host_local_stack_walkthrough.mp4\" /></a>\n\nKnown limitation: `npm test` currently expects IAS bindings and imports `@jest/globals`, so it is not a no-IAS local smoke check.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-3b6b771f-e661-465b-8614-a6c0839f4988\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-3b6b771f-e661-465b-8614-a6c0839f4988\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n","authorType":"User","additions":269,"deletions":13,"changedFiles":10,"files":[{"path":".tasks/setup-dev-environment/CHANGELOG.md","additions":41,"deletions":0},{"path":".tasks/setup-dev-environment/NOTES.md","additions":18,"deletions":0},{"path":".tasks/setup-dev-environment/STATUS.md","additions":33,"deletions":0},{"path":".tasks/setup-dev-environment/TASK_DEFINITION.md","additions":24,"deletions":0},{"path":".tasks/setup-dev-environment/memory-bank/00_initial-setup-findings.md","additions":26,"deletions":0},{"path":".tasks/setup-dev-environment/memory-bank/01_dependency-install-results.md","additions":21,"deletions":0},{"path":".tasks/setup-dev-environment/memory-bank/02_runtime-smoke-results.md","additions":28,"deletions":0},{"path":".tasks/setup-dev-environment/memory-bank/03_aspire-host-results.md","additions":34,"deletions":0},{"path":".tasks/setup-dev-environment/memory-bank/99_task-completion-summary.md","additions":26,"deletions":0},{"path":"apphost.ts","additions":18,"deletions":13}],"baseSha":"68bc925da2a74e9174c168a2f1fde65bedb9ce76","template":null}